(613440, 63679, 16266, '<td valign="top">welllllllllllllll....... hmmm<br/>good attempt.... <br/>the lighting is week.  it seems like you used a flash.. which created rather front, direct lighting.  the background is supposed to be flat black... but i see wrinkles and lines from the cloth.  The croping is rather hmm heavy maybe.  It sits very heavy on the bottom of the frame.. and looses my interest.  The subject matter isn''t ''that'' interesting to me.  This is the angle i ''always'' see those toys.. perhaps from a angle that is not usually viewed could have been interesting.</td>', 'welllllllllllllll....... hmmmgood attempt.... the lighting is week.  it seems like you used a flash.. which created rather front, direct lighting.  the background is supposed to be flat black... but i see wrinkles and lines from the cloth.  The croping is rather hmm heavy maybe.  It sits very heavy on the bottom of the frame.. and looses my interest.  The subject matter isn''t ''that'' interesting to me.  This is the angle i ''always'' see those toys.. perhaps from a angle that is not usually viewed could have been interesting.', '2004-03-08 02:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(613441, 63604, 16266, '<td valign="top">decent... fairly good exposure... i don''t like the framing.. it ''just'' cuts off the handle on the top.. and makes my eye leave the image.  i assume it was taken with a wide angle.. making the tracks curve... the image allready has lines going everywhere then the frame you added to add more lines.. is distracting.</td>', 'decent... fairly good exposure... i don''t like the framing.. it ''just'' cuts off the handle on the top.. and makes my eye leave the image.  i assume it was taken with a wide angle.. making the tracks curve... the image allready has lines going everywhere then the frame you added to add more lines.. is distracting.', '2004-03-08 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
