(613803, 63495, 327, '<td valign="top">I know it''s not...but the entrance to this building looks like it''s tilting to the left.  The left side (crop) is tight and seems crowded. Beautiful glass building and on target for the challenge. Not a bad shot, just a few flaws.</td>', 'I know it''s not...but the entrance to this building looks like it''s tilting to the left.  The left side (crop) is tight and seems crowded. Beautiful glass building and on target for the challenge. Not a bad shot, just a few flaws.', '2004-03-08 10:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(613805, 63565, 17037, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot</td>', 'Excellent shot', '2004-03-08 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
