(613837, 63215, 17037, '<td valign="top">Dramatic</td>', 'Dramatic', '2004-03-08 10:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(613839, 63632, 327, '<td valign="top">lol good idea. Your shot is a bit oof and we don''t see much of the details. Also the lighting is really harsh. Still it was a good idea and clever title.</td>', 'lol good idea. Your shot is a bit oof and we don''t see much of the details. Also the lighting is really harsh. Still it was a good idea and clever title.', '2004-03-08 10:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(613843, 63660, 17037, '<td valign="top">Hard to argue ... nice sot.</td>', 'Hard to argue ... nice sot.', '2004-03-08 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(613844, 63263, 17037, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2004-03-08 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(613846, 63496, 17037, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Powerful</td>', 'Excellent.  Powerful', '2004-03-08 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(613858, 63615, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Hope this is not voted down much for being "unphotographic". To complete the surrealism of the composition I would have cloned out the fire hydrant, the two light spots to the left of the near upright and the light rectangle in the shadow at the bottom of the near upright.</td>', 'Great abstract. Hope this is not voted down much for being "unphotographic". To complete the surrealism of the composition I would have cloned out the fire hydrant, the two light spots to the left of the near upright and the light rectangle in the shadow at the bottom of the near upright.', '2004-03-08 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(613865, 63565, 5792, '<td valign="top">Lacks a focal point but still interesting. It might be nice to see how arranging the most lighted area of the structure according to the ROT would affect this image.</td>', 'Lacks a focal point but still interesting. It might be nice to see how arranging the most lighted area of the structure according to the ROT would affect this image.', '2004-03-08 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(613868, 63623, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the red/green thingee, but there is quite a bit of stuff here.  Sometimes a simple photo tells the story well.  However, good focus and nice colors.</td>', 'Good shot of the red/green thingee, but there is quite a bit of stuff here.  Sometimes a simple photo tells the story well.  However, good focus and nice colors.', '2004-03-08 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613873, 63604, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is good as a sepia with intersting backlighting, but the black inset border is distracting to the image.</td>', 'This is good as a sepia with intersting backlighting, but the black inset border is distracting to the image.', '2004-03-08 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(613874, 63422, 16957, '<td valign="top">This image captures various elements of design with great flair. I particularly like the wide angle and the contrast you''ve created whilst maintaining detail in the bath (swimming pool?) Lighting is perfect. A beautiful image</td>', 'This image captures various elements of design with great flair. I particularly like the wide angle and the contrast you''ve created whilst maintaining detail in the bath (swimming pool?) Lighting is perfect. A beautiful image', '2004-03-08 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(613875, 63584, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very nice branch design.  I wonder if the introduction of a different shape (say, a good looking dead leaf) would give this pleasant photo Wow factor.</td>', 'Very nice branch design.  I wonder if the introduction of a different shape (say, a good looking dead leaf) would give this pleasant photo Wow factor.', '2004-03-08 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(613877, 63264, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented.  Good colors and very reminiscent of a certain age..</td>', 'Nicely presented.  Good colors and very reminiscent of a certain age..', '2004-03-08 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(613880, 63546, 16957, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic subject for the challenge. However, the result is rather bland. It reveals little of the sinister nature or engineering beauty of this plane. Whilst the photo suggests a creative approach, I am left rather unmoved. perhaps a closer approach would have worked better for me or the entire subject in silhoutte - not sure.</td>', 'This is a fantastic subject for the challenge. However, the result is rather bland. It reveals little of the sinister nature or engineering beauty of this plane. Whilst the photo suggests a creative approach, I am left rather unmoved. perhaps a closer approach would have worked better for me or the entire subject in silhoutte - not sure.', '2004-03-08 11:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(613882, 63723, 14476, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot, quite well done.  Could be a tad sharper, but sure meets the Challenge.  Good colors.</td>', 'A difficult shot, quite well done.  Could be a tad sharper, but sure meets the Challenge.  Good colors.', '2004-03-08 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(613885, 63378, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is terrific.  Don''t know what it is (and don''t really care) but I like it a lot.  There''s just a little distraction on the right side curve, but in a way it adds interest.</td>', 'Oh, this is terrific.  Don''t know what it is (and don''t really care) but I like it a lot.  There''s just a little distraction on the right side curve, but in a way it adds interest.', '2004-03-08 11:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(613886, 63496, 5792, '<td valign="top">The lighting, the color, the content, the composition... this is just one super fine image. The only improvement would be to apply noise reduction to the sky. Despite the sky noise this should be a top 10 finisher and in the running for a ribbon.</td>', 'The lighting, the color, the content, the composition... this is just one super fine image. The only improvement would be to apply noise reduction to the sky. Despite the sky noise this should be a top 10 finisher and in the running for a ribbon.', '2004-03-08 11:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(613887, 63588, 14476, '<td valign="top">The undulations and curves are indeed lovely design features.  Good seeing and really excellent photography.   9</td>', 'The undulations and curves are indeed lovely design features.  Good seeing and really excellent photography.   9', '2004-03-08 11:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(613889, 63435, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color choice, composition and overall lighting should put this in the top three. This is a terrific shot.</td>', 'Color choice, composition and overall lighting should put this in the top three. This is a terrific shot.', '2004-03-08 11:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(613890, 63621, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. The browns and dull yellow give this a sepia like quality. One of the top images for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. The browns and dull yellow give this a sepia like quality. One of the top images for this challenge.', '2004-03-08 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613893, 63718, 5792, '<td valign="top">A little noise reduction is needed. This image is very well composed.</td>', 'A little noise reduction is needed. This image is very well composed.', '2004-03-08 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(613895, 63555, 14606, '<td valign="top">Pompido center, Paris?</td>', 'Pompido center, Paris?', '2004-03-08 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(613897, 63519, 5792, '<td valign="top">The lighting, exposure and positioning the industrial plant cropped tightly at the bottom of the frame to hilight the rising clouds makes this a masterful composition. It is a top three image.</td>', 'The lighting, exposure and positioning the industrial plant cropped tightly at the bottom of the frame to hilight the rising clouds makes this a masterful composition. It is a top three image.', '2004-03-08 11:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(613906, 62992, 16148, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition but wish it was a little sharper.  With crisper edges and more contrast it would make my top ten.</td>', 'I really like this composition but wish it was a little sharper.  With crisper edges and more contrast it would make my top ten.', '2004-03-08 11:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(613911, 63588, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building and nice perspective.  I like your composition and choice of black and white.  I expect this entry to score very well.</td>', 'Beautiful building and nice perspective.  I like your composition and choice of black and white.  I expect this entry to score very well.', '2004-03-08 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(613921, 63394, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro entry.  The compostion and lighting are very good.  This looks like a jjbeguin photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful macro entry.  The compostion and lighting are very good.  This looks like a jjbeguin photograph.', '2004-03-08 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(613922, 63591, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like the darkness of the image. You really captured an essence of the area and not just the engineering.</td>', 'I really like the darkness of the image. You really captured an essence of the area and not just the engineering.', '2004-03-08 11:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(613923, 63554, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this one. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the colours in this one. Good luck!', '2004-03-08 11:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(613925, 63580, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like way you composed this shot. I like that you took it on an angle and turned it into black and white. Very effective.</td>', 'I really like way you composed this shot. I like that you took it on an angle and turned it into black and white. Very effective.', '2004-03-08 11:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613926, 63394, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and colours of this image and the way you composed it.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the lighting and colours of this image and the way you composed it.Good luck!', '2004-03-08 11:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(613927, 63579, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.  Just a touch more contrast, in my opinion.  Let me guess, this is upside down from the original!?  BOL</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.  Just a touch more contrast, in my opinion.  Let me guess, this is upside down from the original!?  BOL', '2004-03-08 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(613931, 63675, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry here. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the symmetry here. Good luck!', '2004-03-08 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613933, 63475, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like how this buildling/structure looks like it has wings. I love how you shot it. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like how this buildling/structure looks like it has wings. I love how you shot it. Good luck!', '2004-03-08 11:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(613934, 63445, 15207, '<td valign="top">Hey... cool capture. I like how you composed the shot.</td>', 'Hey... cool capture. I like how you composed the shot.', '2004-03-08 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
