(614068, 63142, 16266, '<td valign="top">allright.  perhaps the night lights are too contrasty. providing either burned in white, or black.</td>', 'allright.  perhaps the night lights are too contrasty. providing either burned in white, or black.', '2004-03-08 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(614069, 63615, 11843, '<td valign="top">Man, too bad there is a shadow....this is a really strong image. But, I can''t help but feel like the image is cut off at an angle. I tried to view it as a part of the composition, but my eye just gets pulled right to it. 7</td>', 'Man, too bad there is a shadow....this is a really strong image. But, I can''t help but feel like the image is cut off at an angle. I tried to view it as a part of the composition, but my eye just gets pulled right to it. 7', '2004-03-08 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(614070, 63683, 16266, '<td valign="top">well... allright.  it feels very constrictive in the frameing.  rather flat lighting except for the dish on the right.</td>', 'well... allright.  it feels very constrictive in the frameing.  rather flat lighting except for the dish on the right.', '2004-03-08 12:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(614071, 63394, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice iamge.  i like the frameing nd the composition.  God background.  Nice detail.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'nice iamge.  i like the frameing nd the composition.  God background.  Nice detail.  I like the lighting.', '2004-03-08 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(614072, 63519, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice nitte shot.  i like the smoke and the lights work well in this shot.</td>', 'nice nitte shot.  i like the smoke and the lights work well in this shot.', '2004-03-08 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(614073, 63234, 16316, '<td valign="top">Like the color and metal. Comp well done also. Shiny top part of chrome seems a bit hot. Keeps leading my eye there without anything to say.</td>', 'Like the color and metal. Comp well done also. Shiny top part of chrome seems a bit hot. Keeps leading my eye there without anything to say.', '2004-03-08 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(614074, 63582, 16266, '<td valign="top">well, allright shot.  very busy and perhaps too closly cropped.  i think it would be ineteresting to be given a little more context.  nice lighting.</td>', 'well, allright shot.  very busy and perhaps too closly cropped.  i think it would be ineteresting to be given a little more context.  nice lighting.', '2004-03-08 12:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(614076, 63634, 16316, '<td valign="top">color and conrast is nice.</td>', 'color and conrast is nice.', '2004-03-08 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(614077, 63570, 16266, '<td valign="top">yep.. that''s a lot<br/>nice lithing and exposure.  it looks like it is in a studio... perhaps it is.<br/>not the most interesting subject.</td>', 'yep.. that''s a lotnice lithing and exposure.  it looks like it is in a studio... perhaps it is.not the most interesting subject.', '2004-03-08 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(614078, 63246, 11843, '<td valign="top">Gotta have Friends! Life would be a dull THUD without them! LOL</td>', 'Gotta have Friends! Life would be a dull THUD without them! LOL', '2004-03-08 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(614080, 63238, 16266, '<td valign="top">decent image.  nice lighting and actually has a bit of a ''mood'' to it.</td>', 'decent image.  nice lighting and actually has a bit of a ''mood'' to it.', '2004-03-08 12:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614081, 63659, 16316, '<td valign="top">works well as b&amp;w.</td>', 'works well as b&w.', '2004-03-08 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(614083, 63632, 16266, '<td valign="top">well allright.  seems a bit oversharpened... or very oversharpened..</td>', 'well allright.  seems a bit oversharpened... or very oversharpened..', '2004-03-08 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(614084, 63651, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image, and subject.  good lighting cropping.</td>', 'nice image, and subject.  good lighting cropping.', '2004-03-08 12:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(614085, 63621, 16316, '<td valign="top">Like the way you have placed the zig-zag.</td>', 'Like the way you have placed the zig-zag.', '2004-03-08 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(614086, 63565, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice lines.  they seem a bit out of focus.  a large DOF might have been nice here.</td>', 'nice lines.  they seem a bit out of focus.  a large DOF might have been nice here.', '2004-03-08 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614087, 63587, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice colors on the pole.  perhaps a little too tight on the cropping.</td>', 'nice colors on the pole.  perhaps a little too tight on the cropping.', '2004-03-08 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(614089, 63587, 16316, '<td valign="top">vivid red, white, and blue. Nice and sharp but I think the pole is placed too much toward center.</td>', 'vivid red, white, and blue. Nice and sharp but I think the pole is placed too much toward center.', '2004-03-08 13:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(614092, 63615, 9982, '<td valign="top">Love the hydrant</td>', 'Love the hydrant', '2004-03-08 13:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(614095, 63605, 9982, '<td valign="top">Is that thumb print deliberate?</td>', 'Is that thumb print deliberate?', '2004-03-08 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(614100, 63661, 16316, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if this is how it was lit or a manipulation but I like the monochromatic approach on this.</td>', 'Don''t know if this is how it was lit or a manipulation but I like the monochromatic approach on this.', '2004-03-08 13:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(614101, 63683, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Did you have to climb to get this? yikes!</td>', 'Nice one. Did you have to climb to get this? yikes!', '2004-03-08 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(614107, 63570, 16316, '<td valign="top">Chuckled at the title! Nice photo.</td>', 'Chuckled at the title! Nice photo.', '2004-03-08 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(614108, 63648, 327, '<td valign="top">I''ve been across this bridge-along with 5000 other cars!! lol Traffic was terrible, but the view, the city is just fantastic. Love the whole area and hope to visit again soon. I love how you''ve captured so much of the bridge. Excellent.</td>', 'I''ve been across this bridge-along with 5000 other cars!! lol Traffic was terrible, but the view, the city is just fantastic. Love the whole area and hope to visit again soon. I love how you''ve captured so much of the bridge. Excellent.', '2004-03-08 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(614109, 63675, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a nice composition.</td>', 'Really a nice composition.', '2004-03-08 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(614110, 63475, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a cool looking building. Fits the challenge well. Good colors. Good luck.</td>', 'Really a cool looking building. Fits the challenge well. Good colors. Good luck.', '2004-03-08 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(614112, 63596, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors. Lovely light and super focus. Nice entry.</td>', 'Pretty colors. Lovely light and super focus. Nice entry.', '2004-03-08 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614114, 63579, 16316, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Like to know how you did it?? Like it a lot.</td>', 'Very clever. Like to know how you did it?? Like it a lot.', '2004-03-08 13:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(614115, 63441, 327, '<td valign="top">Good entry. Just a bit soft but good looking shot.</td>', 'Good entry. Just a bit soft but good looking shot.', '2004-03-08 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(614116, 63376, 16316, '<td valign="top">well composed.</td>', 'well composed.', '2004-03-08 13:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614117, 63139, 327, '<td valign="top">Really an awesome shot. What is this ...?Sky bridge? I love it ....my top three.</td>', 'Really an awesome shot. What is this ...?Sky bridge? I love it ....my top three.', '2004-03-08 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(614118, 63615, 327, '<td valign="top">My top three.....very good.</td>', 'My top three.....very good.', '2004-03-08 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(614119, 63504, 327, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful bridge with an interesting history. Wonderful for this challenge. I hope to visit there again soon. Fantastic entry, good luck.</td>', 'Such a wonderful bridge with an interesting history. Wonderful for this challenge. I hope to visit there again soon. Fantastic entry, good luck.', '2004-03-08 13:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(614120, 63580, 16316, '<td valign="top">Like how you did the spectral highlights. Seems a bit too dark overall on my monitor.</td>', 'Like how you did the spectral highlights. Seems a bit too dark overall on my monitor.', '2004-03-08 13:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614123, 63523, 327, '<td valign="top">Very attractive shot. Love the tones, and focus. Good entry, good luck in this challenge, I hope you do well.</td>', 'Very attractive shot. Love the tones, and focus. Good entry, good luck in this challenge, I hope you do well.', '2004-03-08 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614125, 63632, 16316, '<td valign="top">Not sure if blurred on purpose to give the effect you were trying to achieve, so not taking anything away for that. I do like the coloring of the circuit. Gives an impression of cloth stitching to me. I like it.</td>', 'Not sure if blurred on purpose to give the effect you were trying to achieve, so not taking anything away for that. I do like the coloring of the circuit. Gives an impression of cloth stitching to me. I like it.', '2004-03-08 13:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(614126, 63547, 16316, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Would like to know the technique behind this.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Would like to know the technique behind this.', '2004-03-08 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614129, 63142, 16316, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what to comment other than I like it. I would imagine it accomplishes what you were trying to achieve and nicely done.</td>', 'Don''t know what to comment other than I like it. I would imagine it accomplishes what you were trying to achieve and nicely done.', '2004-03-08 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(614130, 63658, 16316, '<td valign="top">Red and blue abstract works but seems to be out of focus.</td>', 'Red and blue abstract works but seems to be out of focus.', '2004-03-08 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(614133, 63604, 16316, '<td valign="top">I think the added black border detracts because it runs right thru the handle. But also thru too many of the elements of your image. Would''ve liked it better without.</td>', 'I think the added black border detracts because it runs right thru the handle. But also thru too many of the elements of your image. Would''ve liked it better without.', '2004-03-08 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(614139, 63675, 16316, '<td valign="top">Like it! Very sharp. Like the way the colors work in this.</td>', 'Like it! Very sharp. Like the way the colors work in this.', '2004-03-08 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614162, 63393, 327, '<td valign="top">Good color, light, focus, fits the challenge. I hope you ribbon, this is a good interesting shot.</td>', 'Good color, light, focus, fits the challenge. I hope you ribbon, this is a good interesting shot.', '2004-03-08 14:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614163, 63568, 327, '<td valign="top">So glad you mentioned what it was.....I would never have known. Fantastic structure. Love this shot, hope you do well-</td>', 'So glad you mentioned what it was.....I would never have known. Fantastic structure. Love this shot, hope you do well-', '2004-03-08 14:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(614165, 63579, 327, '<td valign="top">lol, inventive, creative, amazing idea. I think it needs a hair more contrast, but other then that minor observation....it''s very good. I hope you do well.</td>', 'lol, inventive, creative, amazing idea. I think it needs a hair more contrast, but other then that minor observation....it''s very good. I hope you do well.', '2004-03-08 14:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(614166, 63605, 14614, '<td valign="top">Strong quality of composition here == minor point - finger print on lower edge detracts, also I''d like to see more contrast between subject and background.</td>', 'Strong quality of composition here == minor point - finger print on lower edge detracts, also I''d like to see more contrast between subject and background.', '2004-03-08 14:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614168, 63625, 327, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see much relation to the challenge here. This is a nice shot, beautiful area but beyond that??? If I''m missing the point .....please PM me.</td>', 'I really don''t see much relation to the challenge here. This is a nice shot, beautiful area but beyond that??? If I''m missing the point .....please PM me.', '2004-03-08 14:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(614169, 63555, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the shiny main subject and the repetition... the frame is a bit busy and takes something away from the composition</td>', 'Like the shiny main subject and the repetition... the frame is a bit busy and takes something away from the composition', '2004-03-08 14:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614170, 63523, 14614, '<td valign="top">nicely composed and framed, exellent use of dof -- I think I''d like a smidge more room on the sides as it appears (could be an optical illusion) that you''ve cut off a bit of the circle.</td>', 'nicely composed and framed, exellent use of dof -- I think I''d like a smidge more room on the sides as it appears (could be an optical illusion) that you''ve cut off a bit of the circle.', '2004-03-08 14:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(614172, 63579, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent use of b&amp;w, good twist on the design idea, perhaps only I would notice as I''m a former ballet dancer but those have to be the oddest toe shoes ever! ;)  Something about the shim (or whatever you used for the wood) seems off to me maybe because it lacks symetry?  not sure.  As is - well done</td>', 'excellent use of b&w, good twist on the design idea, perhaps only I would notice as I''m a former ballet dancer but those have to be the oddest toe shoes ever! ;)  Something about the shim (or whatever you used for the wood) seems off to me maybe because it lacks symetry?  not sure.  As is - well done', '2004-03-08 14:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614173, 63496, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great Naperville shot.  Not an easy subject to capture.  Not sure if I like the trees in the foreground - they do offer perspective and framing but their chunky appearance is somehow out of place with the sleek design of the main structure.  As is, nicely done.</td>', 'Great Naperville shot.  Not an easy subject to capture.  Not sure if I like the trees in the foreground - they do offer perspective and framing but their chunky appearance is somehow out of place with the sleek design of the main structure.  As is, nicely done.', '2004-03-08 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614175, 62907, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and strong composition - the "numark" in the lower right holds my eye in an uninteresting part of the frame.</td>', 'Nice tones and strong composition - the "numark" in the lower right holds my eye in an uninteresting part of the frame.', '2004-03-08 14:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614176, 63679, 14614, '<td valign="top">seems a bit blurry</td>', 'seems a bit blurry', '2004-03-08 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(614178, 63584, 14614, '<td valign="top">Kind of a jumble here but not quite an abstract, I''d like some aspect to take center stage.</td>', 'Kind of a jumble here but not quite an abstract, I''d like some aspect to take center stage.', '2004-03-08 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(614179, 63476, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice idea... low DOF is a bit distracting.. decent light.</td>', 'nice idea... low DOF is a bit distracting.. decent light.', '2004-03-08 14:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(614180, 63568, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image.. great cropping and great exposure.</td>', 'nice image.. great cropping and great exposure.', '2004-03-08 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(614181, 63523, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  rather contrasty, but it might fit the image.  i think the cropping is done well.</td>', 'interesting shot.  rather contrasty, but it might fit the image.  i think the cropping is done well.', '2004-03-08 14:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(614183, 63675, 16266, '<td valign="top">great repetition and nice saturation with the colors.</td>', 'great repetition and nice saturation with the colors.', '2004-03-08 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(614184, 63570, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is from one of my current favourite cars - the gorgeous Range Rover.  Personally, I think the rear lights are more impressive, especially when the break lights come on...  Anyhoo.  This is a great choice of material for the challenge, and you''ve captured it very well.  Super focus.  9.</td>', 'This is from one of my current favourite cars - the gorgeous Range Rover.  Personally, I think the rear lights are more impressive, especially when the break lights come on...  Anyhoo.  This is a great choice of material for the challenge, and you''ve captured it very well.  Super focus.  9.', '2004-03-08 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(614185, 63599, 16266, '<td valign="top">it looks like you used a bit of blur here, or ese it is out of focus, either way it is a bit distracting.  nice colors though.</td>', 'it looks like you used a bit of blur here, or ese it is out of focus, either way it is a bit distracting.  nice colors though.', '2004-03-08 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(614187, 63721, 16266, '<td valign="top">allrght, very rigid with the cropping.. but perhaps nice as an abstract.. painterly image.  interesting..  the more i look at it the more i like it.</td>', 'allrght, very rigid with the cropping.. but perhaps nice as an abstract.. painterly image.  interesting..  the more i look at it the more i like it.', '2004-03-08 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(614188, 63720, 16004, '<td valign="top">I''m a total sucker for neon, so I''m naturally drawn to this one.  The detail is impressive, and the concept of shiny metal buttons screams of the challenge.  Very well done, good choice...  Unusually, the border also actually compliments the image.  10.</td>', 'I''m a total sucker for neon, so I''m naturally drawn to this one.  The detail is impressive, and the concept of shiny metal buttons screams of the challenge.  Very well done, good choice...  Unusually, the border also actually compliments the image.  10.', '2004-03-08 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(614189, 63217, 12827, '<td valign="top">good contrast, I like the lines the belt makes!</td>', 'good contrast, I like the lines the belt makes!', '2004-03-08 14:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(614190, 63584, 16004, '<td valign="top">It''s a good image, but I not really convinced this fall under the remit of Design and Engineering.  Very pretty, not very relevant, but a nice image all the same.  7.</td>', 'It''s a good image, but I not really convinced this fall under the remit of Design and Engineering.  Very pretty, not very relevant, but a nice image all the same.  7.', '2004-03-08 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(614191, 63371, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice pov, sky provides a good backdrop, I find the red roof a bit distracting (I think because it''s such a strong red that it pulls my eye to an unimportant part of the frame).  As is, well done</td>', 'nice pov, sky provides a good backdrop, I find the red roof a bit distracting (I think because it''s such a strong red that it pulls my eye to an unimportant part of the frame).  As is, well done', '2004-03-08 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(614192, 63528, 16266, '<td valign="top">allright shot.. very direct strong light.. that is too strong in my opinion  the sepia works well</td>', 'allright shot.. very direct strong light.. that is too strong in my opinion  the sepia works well', '2004-03-08 14:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(614193, 63246, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image, and good exposure.  perhaps over sharpened a little.  nice crop</td>', 'nice image, and good exposure.  perhaps over sharpened a little.  nice crop', '2004-03-08 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(614195, 63381, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.. it seems a bit hmmm i dunno... like you softened it a bit cause it was blurry allready.. or something.. but allright.</td>', 'interesting shot.. it seems a bit hmmm i dunno... like you softened it a bit cause it was blurry allready.. or something.. but allright.', '2004-03-08 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(614196, 63688, 16266, '<td valign="top">underexposed.  ok shot, but doesn''t really keep my interest.</td>', 'underexposed.  ok shot, but doesn''t really keep my interest.', '2004-03-08 14:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(614197, 62907, 16004, '<td valign="top">This would look great in a company brochure!  I love the geometric feel of circles and edges around the arm.  I wonder though if you considered getting rid of the Numark sticker in the bottom right - the grey around the sticker is pretty uniform so it should be relatively straight-forward to copy a small square.  I just find the sticker distracting...   Still, I think this is a super shot, taken at a great angle, with a very clear focus and totally fulfills the challenge criteria. 9.</td>', 'This would look great in a company brochure!  I love the geometric feel of circles and edges around the arm.  I wonder though if you considered getting rid of the Numark sticker in the bottom right - the grey around the sticker is pretty uniform so it should be relatively straight-forward to copy a small square.  I just find the sticker distracting...   Still, I think this is a super shot, taken at a great angle, with a very clear focus and totally fulfills the challenge criteria. 9.', '2004-03-08 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(614198, 63715, 16266, '<td valign="top">rather constrictive framing... and not too interesting taken ''dead on''.. fairly flat lighting.</td>', 'rather constrictive framing... and not too interesting taken ''dead on''.. fairly flat lighting.', '2004-03-08 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614199, 63678, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice with the red color on the left.  a little soft, good DOF...  not THAT interesting.</td>', 'nice with the red color on the left.  a little soft, good DOF...  not THAT interesting.', '2004-03-08 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(614200, 63580, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice idea, nice lighting.. howerver rather underexposed.  i know you wanted it to be dusk... but it is still underexposed.</td>', 'nice idea, nice lighting.. howerver rather underexposed.  i know you wanted it to be dusk... but it is still underexposed.', '2004-03-08 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(614201, 63445, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting framing and vantage point.  a little pixelated or blurry at the bottom.</td>', 'interesting framing and vantage point.  a little pixelated or blurry at the bottom.', '2004-03-08 14:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614202, 63565, 16004, '<td valign="top">Clearly one structural engineer has been too busy with his LSD...  An interesting shot, though a bit too cluttered yor me to be able to fully take it all in. 7.</td>', 'Clearly one structural engineer has been too busy with his LSD...  An interesting shot, though a bit too cluttered yor me to be able to fully take it all in. 7.', '2004-03-08 14:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(614204, 63545, 811, '<td valign="top">The lines leading up and to the right form an interesting strength for the picture.  Also, the single "spot" of yellow and red gives the eyes somewhere to go.</td>', 'The lines leading up and to the right form an interesting strength for the picture.  Also, the single "spot" of yellow and red gives the eyes somewhere to go.', '2004-03-08 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(614206, 63432, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice abstract.  it is tough to see what it is. nice lighitng.</td>', 'nice abstract.  it is tough to see what it is. nice lighitng.', '2004-03-08 14:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(614207, 63615, 16266, '<td valign="top">great color and exposure.  nice blues.  i like this one.</td>', 'great color and exposure.  nice blues.  i like this one.', '2004-03-08 14:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(614208, 63346, 12827, '<td valign="top">perhaps more centered?</td>', 'perhaps more centered?', '2004-03-08 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(614209, 63621, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice abstract image.  good exposure, i like the relfection.  i think i wish the bottom ''grub'' was there.. or bottom part of the reflection.</td>', 'nice abstract image.  good exposure, i like the relfection.  i think i wish the bottom ''grub'' was there.. or bottom part of the reflection.', '2004-03-08 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(614210, 63565, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast in this one.  I wish the light had been in such a position to cause more fo the brighter yellow spots.</td>', 'I like the color contrast in this one.  I wish the light had been in such a position to cause more fo the brighter yellow spots.', '2004-03-08 14:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(614211, 63139, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice repetition, and great exposure.  good framing</td>', 'nice repetition, and great exposure.  good framing', '2004-03-08 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614212, 63456, 12827, '<td valign="top">Portrait instead of landscape? I like this but the office building seems distracting</td>', 'Portrait instead of landscape? I like this but the office building seems distracting', '2004-03-08 14:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(614213, 63662, 16266, '<td valign="top">background is a bit distracting, the image is soft, or a touch blury like it was taken at a low shutter spead or from the car... or zoomed in a lot.</td>', 'background is a bit distracting, the image is soft, or a touch blury like it was taken at a low shutter spead or from the car... or zoomed in a lot.', '2004-03-08 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(614214, 63393, 7889, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour, design, very interesting photo, best of luck</td>', 'Excellent colour, design, very interesting photo, best of luck', '2004-03-08 14:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(614215, 63573, 12827, '<td valign="top">I love the lines!</td>', 'I love the lines!', '2004-03-08 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614217, 63588, 7889, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I love the form and shadow and this looks great in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Wonderful! I love the form and shadow and this looks great in b&w.', '2004-03-08 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(614218, 63627, 12827, '<td valign="top">DoF a little too shallow</td>', 'DoF a little too shallow', '2004-03-08 14:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614219, 63584, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a stronger focus would have really helped this picture to stand out.  As it is, there is so much "movement" in the picture, it is hard to determine what you are wanting to say about it, and the slightly soft limbs/twigs in the foreground don''t help to direct the focus anywhere.  Perhaps if there was a bird or something sitting somewhere to be a focal point, it would be more engaging.</td>', 'I think a stronger focus would have really helped this picture to stand out.  As it is, there is so much "movement" in the picture, it is hard to determine what you are wanting to say about it, and the slightly soft limbs/twigs in the foreground don''t help to direct the focus anywhere.  Perhaps if there was a bird or something sitting somewhere to be a focal point, it would be more engaging.', '2004-03-08 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(614221, 63422, 7889, '<td valign="top">Impressive photo. exposure is spot on, like this a lot</td>', 'Impressive photo. exposure is spot on, like this a lot', '2004-03-08 14:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(614223, 63659, 7889, '<td valign="top">It always suprises me that sometimes a great photo does not need to be complicated, as your entry proves. It looks very good. I like this.</td>', 'It always suprises me that sometimes a great photo does not need to be complicated, as your entry proves. It looks very good. I like this.', '2004-03-08 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(614227, 63659, 16266, '<td valign="top">very high contrast.  fairly interesting, but not enough detail in the darks and the whites are blown out.</td>', 'very high contrast.  fairly interesting, but not enough detail in the darks and the whites are blown out.', '2004-03-08 14:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(614228, 63336, 16004, '<td valign="top">This a new 3-series?  I don''t know - it''s a good choice of subject, but I do think you''ve chosen a fairly ordinary aspect of the design.  True, everyone seems to focus on light clusters and the like - but your shot is more about providers of great design, rather than the design itself.  Also I thought the trees reflected are a wee bit distracting - perhaps a bit of cropping might be good..?   I want to give this a 6.5, but I can''t, so I''ll round it to 7.</td>', 'This a new 3-series?  I don''t know - it''s a good choice of subject, but I do think you''ve chosen a fairly ordinary aspect of the design.  True, everyone seems to focus on light clusters and the like - but your shot is more about providers of great design, rather than the design itself.  Also I thought the trees reflected are a wee bit distracting - perhaps a bit of cropping might be good..?   I want to give this a 6.5, but I can''t, so I''ll round it to 7.', '2004-03-08 14:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(614230, 63138, 16266, '<td valign="top">i like the moon i think.. great textures and colors.. and framing.</td>', 'i like the moon i think.. great textures and colors.. and framing.', '2004-03-08 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(614231, 63720, 16266, '<td valign="top">hmm.... well allright, not that intersting. seems more like a sign than a photo, or art or something.... ok</td>', 'hmm.... well allright, not that intersting. seems more like a sign than a photo, or art or something.... ok', '2004-03-08 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(614232, 63601, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the bridges show "contrasting" movement.  It is a little tight at the top, I think.  BW works well.</td>', 'I like the way the bridges show "contrasting" movement.  It is a little tight at the top, I think.  BW works well.', '2004-03-08 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(614233, 63472, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice detail.. and nice that it is not oversharpened, like all the other close ups.  great exposure and etail.</td>', 'nice detail.. and nice that it is not oversharpened, like all the other close ups.  great exposure and etail.', '2004-03-08 14:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(614234, 63660, 16004, '<td valign="top">It''s a model!  blimey - took me a while to actually twig there - very excellent shot fooling me.  I''m not entirely sure it is a model actually.  Is it?  Dammit, what a convincing picture.  You make this?  Very well done.  Totally splendid!  10.</td>', 'It''s a model!  blimey - took me a while to actually twig there - very excellent shot fooling me.  I''m not entirely sure it is a model actually.  Is it?  Dammit, what a convincing picture.  You make this?  Very well done.  Totally splendid!  10.', '2004-03-08 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614235, 63688, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but I think the colors need to be more "brilliant" to really stand out.</td>', 'Good composition, but I think the colors need to be more "brilliant" to really stand out.', '2004-03-08 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(614236, 63494, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition on this one.</td>', 'I like the colors and composition on this one.', '2004-03-08 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(614237, 63625, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in this one.</td>', 'Nice contrast in this one.', '2004-03-08 14:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614238, 63213, 811, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  It almost looks like the strings are a bit blown out in the foreground.  Otherwise, this would be a really eyecatching shot.</td>', 'Good perspective.  It almost looks like the strings are a bit blown out in the foreground.  Otherwise, this would be a really eyecatching shot.', '2004-03-08 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614239, 63523, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the tight frame and how you have used the ring to frame the amusement park.  Nice bw.</td>', 'I like the tight frame and how you have used the ring to frame the amusement park.  Nice bw.', '2004-03-08 14:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(614243, 63639, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the coloring you have chosen seems to lack a bit.  Maybe a bit more contrast would help.</td>', 'Good composition, but the coloring you have chosen seems to lack a bit.  Maybe a bit more contrast would help.', '2004-03-08 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(614245, 63603, 17530, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been a real ''hum-dinger'', but the top of that bush ruined this photo for me.<br/>3</td>', 'Would''ve been a real ''hum-dinger'', but the top of that bush ruined this photo for me.3', '2004-03-08 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(614246, 63504, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I like how the bridge draws the viewer into the scene.</td>', 'Great colors.  I like how the bridge draws the viewer into the scene.', '2004-03-08 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(614254, 63167, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.', '2004-03-08 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(614255, 63445, 18191, '<td valign="top">Pick one line to be your parallel and stick with it---otherwise, as is the case here, the illusion is a tilted building.</td>', 'Pick one line to be your parallel and stick with it---otherwise, as is the case here, the illusion is a tilted building.', '2004-03-08 15:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(614257, 63694, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the colors, and the composition adds some interest as well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the colors, and the composition adds some interest as well.', '2004-03-08 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(614260, 63381, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred effect. Is this from Rye Playland? Also, A Long exposure with the Starship 2000 sign stable would make a wonderful shot.</td>', 'I like the blurred effect. Is this from Rye Playland? Also, A Long exposure with the Starship 2000 sign stable would make a wonderful shot.', '2004-03-08 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(614269, 63615, 7889, '<td valign="top">Nearly a WOW photo, I love the form of the structure and the colours are outstanding, but...the object in the bottom right just spoils the overall impact a little. Nevertheless I am certain you will be placed quite high.</td>', 'Nearly a WOW photo, I love the form of the structure and the colours are outstanding, but...the object in the bottom right just spoils the overall impact a little. Nevertheless I am certain you will be placed quite high.', '2004-03-08 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(614271, 63523, 7889, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I love this site is to be able to see some great photos. I think this is a fantastic photo. You have done a great job and I hope you get rewarded with a high place. Going into my favs. My fav of the challenge.</td>', 'One of the reasons I love this site is to be able to see some great photos. I think this is a fantastic photo. You have done a great job and I hope you get rewarded with a high place. Going into my favs. My fav of the challenge.', '2004-03-08 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(614274, 63579, 7889, '<td valign="top">Very good photo and you made the right decision to use b&amp;w rather than colour for this. Lighting is good and the idea is original</td>', 'Very good photo and you made the right decision to use b&w rather than colour for this. Lighting is good and the idea is original', '2004-03-08 15:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(614275, 63537, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great image. I would have preferred it to be cropped so that I see less of the background, not an easy exercise because of the angle''s needed for the crop. Good luck</td>', 'Great image. I would have preferred it to be cropped so that I see less of the background, not an easy exercise because of the angle''s needed for the crop. Good luck', '2004-03-08 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(614278, 63576, 7889, '<td valign="top">DOF drops off a bit too much towards the bottom and there is something centre right that catches the eye. The image suits b&amp;w well</td>', 'DOF drops off a bit too much towards the bottom and there is something centre right that catches the eye. The image suits b&w well', '2004-03-08 15:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(614279, 63138, 2752, '<td valign="top">I think that I would have left the moon out...The tiles and colors of the Gaudi are lovely.</td>', 'I think that I would have left the moon out...The tiles and colors of the Gaudi are lovely.', '2004-03-08 15:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(614280, 63213, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, harp? I''m wondering about the composition - either you are shooting up and that''s the perspective or you tried to do a diagonal. The image is fairly abstract and so the strength is with the geometric shapes. The lines are interesting but I dont think they have enough strength to capture the attention of the viewer for too long.</td>', 'Hrm, harp? I''m wondering about the composition - either you are shooting up and that''s the perspective or you tried to do a diagonal. The image is fairly abstract and so the strength is with the geometric shapes. The lines are interesting but I dont think they have enough strength to capture the attention of the viewer for too long.', '2004-03-08 16:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(614283, 63387, 6008, '<td valign="top">The use of the editing filter has rendered this image somewhat like an abstract popart image. It doesnt really hold much interest to me.</td>', 'The use of the editing filter has rendered this image somewhat like an abstract popart image. It doesnt really hold much interest to me.', '2004-03-08 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(614284, 63660, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, very 3d-looking. Good symmetry with a good non-distracting background. Only nit-pick is the white speck on the black.</td>', 'Cool shot, very 3d-looking. Good symmetry with a good non-distracting background. Only nit-pick is the white speck on the black.', '2004-03-08 16:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614285, 63321, 327, '<td valign="top">:) Fun idea. Prehistoric engineering.</td>', ':) Fun idea. Prehistoric engineering.', '2004-03-08 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614286, 63644, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I like the broken spoke that ''allows'' us to view across the paddle to the other wheel. Good textures and the color is nicely drab showing age. I''m not sure if it''s low resolution, oversharpening or over contrast, or that the shot is ''too busy'' but it just loses out on some ''wow''. Still it''s a good image, I like it</td>', 'Great composition and I like the broken spoke that ''allows'' us to view across the paddle to the other wheel. Good textures and the color is nicely drab showing age. I''m not sure if it''s low resolution, oversharpening or over contrast, or that the shot is ''too busy'' but it just loses out on some ''wow''. Still it''s a good image, I like it', '2004-03-08 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(614290, 63579, 14211, '<td valign="top">F antastic how on earth did you manage this BRAVO</td>', 'F antastic how on earth did you manage this BRAVO', '2004-03-08 16:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(614291, 63639, 14211, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge really well [in my opinion]</td>', 'meets the challenge really well [in my opinion]', '2004-03-08 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(614292, 63661, 14211, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2004-03-08 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(614296, 63688, 14211, '<td valign="top">now that takes engineering!</td>', 'now that takes engineering!', '2004-03-08 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(614298, 63537, 14211, '<td valign="top">that says it all!</td>', 'that says it all!', '2004-03-08 16:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(614300, 63694, 14211, '<td valign="top">I like the set up</td>', 'I like the set up', '2004-03-08 16:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(614301, 63238, 14211, '<td valign="top">good thinking[like the van too]</td>', 'good thinking[like the van too]', '2004-03-08 16:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(614304, 63632, 14211, '<td valign="top">i guess so.</td>', 'i guess so.', '2004-03-08 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(614309, 63574, 14211, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-03-08 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(614316, 63141, 14211, '<td valign="top">right on!</td>', 'right on!', '2004-03-08 16:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(614318, 63621, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like what appears to be windows, both in the coloring and the shapes. The crane reflection makes it different, but I probably would have been content with just the windows. Not sure what happened at the bottom, whether it''s the top of trees, some kind of cloning or what, but unfortunately it distracts from the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like what appears to be windows, both in the coloring and the shapes. The crane reflection makes it different, but I probably would have been content with just the windows. Not sure what happened at the bottom, whether it''s the top of trees, some kind of cloning or what, but unfortunately it distracts from the rest of the image.', '2004-03-08 16:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(614322, 63186, 14211, '<td valign="top">right on!</td>', 'right on!', '2004-03-08 16:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(614324, 63141, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting camera, good textures, nice detail, quite sharp. It''s fine as it is, but you could have also tried either bouncing light on the right or adding another light there to lighten the edge of the camera and try and get rid of the long shadow going off frame.</td>', 'Interesting camera, good textures, nice detail, quite sharp. It''s fine as it is, but you could have also tried either bouncing light on the right or adding another light there to lighten the edge of the camera and try and get rid of the long shadow going off frame.', '2004-03-08 16:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(614327, 63393, 6008, '<td valign="top">Nice blend of colors, but also they have a dirty or earthiness tone which adds to the mood. The metal is evenly lit and the crosshatches add interest.I also like the dark triangle that breaks up the repetetive pattern. Great shot, I really like it.</td>', 'Nice blend of colors, but also they have a dirty or earthiness tone which adds to the mood. The metal is evenly lit and the crosshatches add interest.I also like the dark triangle that breaks up the repetetive pattern. Great shot, I really like it.', '2004-03-08 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(614331, 63565, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very chaotic! Very abstract, interesting pattern, I like the light shafts on the structure that adds to the chaos, and the coloring of the pipes(?) go well with the blue sky in the background.</td>', 'Very chaotic! Very abstract, interesting pattern, I like the light shafts on the structure that adds to the chaos, and the coloring of the pipes(?) go well with the blue sky in the background.', '2004-03-08 16:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(614334, 63634, 6008, '<td valign="top">The crop is interesting and not the usual symetrical image. The detail is great, nicely sharp, contrast is great, and the color of the sky in the corners is really nice. Shows off the wonderful architecture well.</td>', 'The crop is interesting and not the usual symetrical image. The detail is great, nicely sharp, contrast is great, and the color of the sky in the corners is really nice. Shows off the wonderful architecture well.', '2004-03-08 16:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(614337, 63422, 6008, '<td valign="top">The crop is interesting, and probably wasnt an easy task finding the right angle to use. I like the color scheme, which is the first thing that I noticed. The black and white is quite stark, and yet there is the polished wood that warms it up a little and the streak of color with the daylight streaming in. Very geometrical with the shapes leading the eye around the image nicely, stopping briefly to take in the added detail such as the reflection in the water and the texture of the wood. Great shot!</td>', 'The crop is interesting, and probably wasnt an easy task finding the right angle to use. I like the color scheme, which is the first thing that I noticed. The black and white is quite stark, and yet there is the polished wood that warms it up a little and the streak of color with the daylight streaming in. Very geometrical with the shapes leading the eye around the image nicely, stopping briefly to take in the added detail such as the reflection in the water and the texture of the wood. Great shot!', '2004-03-08 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(614339, 63432, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a new angle for me. I''ve driven past this structure a few times and know it''s magnificence and I think you were able to capture it well. The composition is good, good use of negative space, and also forcing the eye through the image. I like the color of the metal and its reflections also.</td>', 'This is certainly a new angle for me. I''ve driven past this structure a few times and know it''s magnificence and I think you were able to capture it well. The composition is good, good use of negative space, and also forcing the eye through the image. I like the color of the metal and its reflections also.', '2004-03-08 16:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(614340, 63675, 16957, '<td valign="top">This could so easily have been quite a mundane shot but it''s actually very striking with a persistent senses of drama as if this was a play we were watching. The lighting is very dramatic - how did you do it? Shot would have been improved perhaps by getting the digger arms more symmetrical but guess you didn''t have much control over that (?!)</td>', 'This could so easily have been quite a mundane shot but it''s actually very striking with a persistent senses of drama as if this was a play we were watching. The lighting is very dramatic - how did you do it? Shot would have been improved perhaps by getting the digger arms more symmetrical but guess you didn''t have much control over that (?!)', '2004-03-08 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(614343, 63615, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very effective composition and colours and a wonderful interepretation of the challenge. Small points - if you have photo-editing software you could have got rid of vehicles (?) protruding above parapets and also fire hydrant (?) in lower right (or croped a bit higher). Excellent image overall.</td>', 'Very effective composition and colours and a wonderful interepretation of the challenge. Small points - if you have photo-editing software you could have got rid of vehicles (?) protruding above parapets and also fire hydrant (?) in lower right (or croped a bit higher). Excellent image overall.', '2004-03-08 16:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614345, 63604, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I spotted was the line on the left, and after trying to work out what the black line was connected to in the image I realised it was a border. In other words I think with a detail-orientated image that it distracts a little by becoming part of the image rather than highlighting it. The image itself is good, I like the sepia toning, and the texture of the stones/rocks are good, esp with the dappled light. I''m not sure if you used a wide-angle or telephoto lens or whether the track is like that, but the perspective seems almost buckled in places.</td>', 'First thing I spotted was the line on the left, and after trying to work out what the black line was connected to in the image I realised it was a border. In other words I think with a detail-orientated image that it distracts a little by becoming part of the image rather than highlighting it. The image itself is good, I like the sepia toning, and the texture of the stones/rocks are good, esp with the dappled light. I''m not sure if you used a wide-angle or telephoto lens or whether the track is like that, but the perspective seems almost buckled in places.', '2004-03-08 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(614348, 63642, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a very good interpretation of design as it interacts with environment. While  I do wonder if the building is tilting just a little bit to the right, the atmospheric conditions give the buildings a special beauty.</td>', 'This is a very good interpretation of design as it interacts with environment. While  I do wonder if the building is tilting just a little bit to the right, the atmospheric conditions give the buildings a special beauty.', '2004-03-08 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(614349, 63720, 16957, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail this looks like a potential top 10. on closer inspection, however, it loses a bit of impact by the out of focus letters. perhaps this was an unavoidable consequence of the device''s lighting but looks like you might have used a slightly higher position to eliminate the shadows behind the letters. Also, a pity about the highlight and flare at top of blue ring. A well imagined shot though and these small points are what makes the difference between an 8/9 and a 6/7</td>', 'From the thumbnail this looks like a potential top 10. on closer inspection, however, it loses a bit of impact by the out of focus letters. perhaps this was an unavoidable consequence of the device''s lighting but looks like you might have used a slightly higher position to eliminate the shadows behind the letters. Also, a pity about the highlight and flare at top of blue ring. A well imagined shot though and these small points are what makes the difference between an 8/9 and a 6/7', '2004-03-08 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(614350, 63639, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think this image could have benefitted from a little more contrast. The long ''arm'' of the crame blends in a little too well with the clouds and so doesnt stand out as well as it probably should. The perspective of both the building and the crane looks to be tilted and a slight rotation in an editing program could have helped that some too.</td>', 'I think this image could have benefitted from a little more contrast. The long ''arm'' of the crame blends in a little too well with the clouds and so doesnt stand out as well as it probably should. The perspective of both the building and the crane looks to be tilted and a slight rotation in an editing program could have helped that some too.', '2004-03-08 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(614351, 63394, 14476, '<td valign="top">You have done a good job in interpreting the challenge and have rendered this ancient design nicely.</td>', 'You have done a good job in interpreting the challenge and have rendered this ancient design nicely.', '2004-03-08 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614354, 63685, 16957, '<td valign="top">Imaginative choice of subject. On close inspection I''d have liked to see more of the foreground in focus but nicely composed nevertheless. Is this actually black and white or colour?</td>', 'Imaginative choice of subject. On close inspection I''d have liked to see more of the foreground in focus but nicely composed nevertheless. Is this actually black and white or colour?', '2004-03-08 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(614356, 63445, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great use of foreground and background elements to ''create'' an interesting image. This certainly does look like a tower on fire. If I were to be very picky I would suggest cropping off the bottom just past the plague so it gives it a more ''natural'' look/feel and not just a building and a work of art.</td>', 'Great use of foreground and background elements to ''create'' an interesting image. This certainly does look like a tower on fire. If I were to be very picky I would suggest cropping off the bottom just past the plague so it gives it a more ''natural'' look/feel and not just a building and a work of art.', '2004-03-08 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(614357, 63530, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely design and workmanship well captured.  The doors alone are magnificant, the foundation deserves its own image and, well, you must have had a great deal of fun enjoying this Mill.  You weren''t perhaps blessed with the best weather as it''s a touch dark, but still you have a good image.</td>', 'Lovely design and workmanship well captured.  The doors alone are magnificant, the foundation deserves its own image and, well, you must have had a great deal of fun enjoying this Mill.  You weren''t perhaps blessed with the best weather as it''s a touch dark, but still you have a good image.', '2004-03-08 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(614358, 63675, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting ''creation'' of the mechanical arch. The yellow of the machines goes great with the blue sky. Nice detail and sharpness.</td>', 'Interesting ''creation'' of the mechanical arch. The yellow of the machines goes great with the blue sky. Nice detail and sharpness.', '2004-03-08 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(614359, 63635, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge and delightful colors.  Good patterns too!  I expect you tried this one with the mast off center as well and chose this composition.  Nice.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge and delightful colors.  Good patterns too!  I expect you tried this one with the mast off center as well and chose this composition.  Nice.', '2004-03-08 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(614361, 63394, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tones create such a great moody image. Wonderful lighting, good use of light/shadow to enhance the mood, great subject choice, and nice detail, texture, and sharpness. A really nice image.</td>', 'The tones create such a great moody image. Wonderful lighting, good use of light/shadow to enhance the mood, great subject choice, and nice detail, texture, and sharpness. A really nice image.', '2004-03-08 17:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(614362, 63606, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, good shot.  I always wondered what the innards of one of those things looked like!  Good detail, nice composition.  8</td>', 'Oh, good shot.  I always wondered what the innards of one of those things looked like!  Good detail, nice composition.  8', '2004-03-08 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(614364, 63523, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent seeing to capture this one.  It''s always a pleasure to see an interesting scene made even more so by that imaginative circular framing.  I have to say the border is not, in my opinion, such a happy choice because it seems to crowd the photograph.  Still easily a  9</td>', 'Excellent seeing to capture this one.  It''s always a pleasure to see an interesting scene made even more so by that imaginative circular framing.  I have to say the border is not, in my opinion, such a happy choice because it seems to crowd the photograph.  Still easily a  9', '2004-03-08 17:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(614365, 63580, 14476, '<td valign="top">The innards of our electronic toys are always facinating.  You did a good job capturing this one.</td>', 'The innards of our electronic toys are always facinating.  You did a good job capturing this one.', '2004-03-08 17:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(614367, 63718, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot of this architectural gem.  You used the clouds well in your composition.</td>', 'Nice clear shot of this architectural gem.  You used the clouds well in your composition.', '2004-03-08 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(614369, 63432, 14476, '<td valign="top">Glad you told me what it was ''cause I wouldn''t have recognized it.  Still, an intriquing image and a very nice take on the Challenge.  Beautifully photographed.</td>', 'Glad you told me what it was ''cause I wouldn''t have recognized it.  Still, an intriquing image and a very nice take on the Challenge.  Beautifully photographed.', '2004-03-08 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(614372, 63579, 14476, '<td valign="top">Do not try this at home?  A delightful take on the Challenge and nicely photographed.</td>', 'Do not try this at home?  A delightful take on the Challenge and nicely photographed.', '2004-03-08 17:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(614373, 63346, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good seeing and well photographed.</td>', 'Good seeing and well photographed.', '2004-03-08 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(614374, 63371, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a charming bridge.  Nicely photographed as well.</td>', 'Oh, what a charming bridge.  Nicely photographed as well.', '2004-03-08 17:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(614375, 63603, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good seeing here and you chose your lighting carefully for effective shadows.  Well done.</td>', 'Good seeing here and you chose your lighting carefully for effective shadows.  Well done.', '2004-03-08 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(614377, 63443, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lots of fun things going on in this photograph.  Good composition and sense of humor.</td>', 'Lots of fun things going on in this photograph.  Good composition and sense of humor.', '2004-03-08 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614378, 63213, 14476, '<td valign="top">Charming subject and good take on the Challenge.  I do wish more of this lovely instrument was in focus.</td>', 'Charming subject and good take on the Challenge.  I do wish more of this lovely instrument was in focus.', '2004-03-08 17:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(614379, 63615, 14476, '<td valign="top">This, of course, is excellent, right down to the fire hydrant.  It''s just a matter of "which ribbon."  10</td>', 'This, of course, is excellent, right down to the fire hydrant.  It''s just a matter of "which ribbon."  10', '2004-03-08 17:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(614380, 63644, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good colors, excellent composition.  These are hard to do and you did it well.</td>', 'Good colors, excellent composition.  These are hard to do and you did it well.', '2004-03-08 17:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(614381, 63537, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good one and a brave photographer (or looong lens) to get this image.  Nice.  9</td>', 'Good one and a brave photographer (or looong lens) to get this image.  Nice.  9', '2004-03-08 17:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(614382, 63167, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good title for this architectural juxtapositioning.  Nicely photographed too.</td>', 'Good title for this architectural juxtapositioning.  Nicely photographed too.', '2004-03-08 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(614384, 63445, 14476, '<td valign="top">This composition is really, really good.  Congratulations on seeing it and photographing it so nicely.  8</td>', 'This composition is really, really good.  Congratulations on seeing it and photographing it so nicely.  8', '2004-03-08 17:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(614386, 63568, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very, very good seeing on this one.  Colors are perfect and it does have that Wow factor.   10</td>', 'Very, very good seeing on this one.  Colors are perfect and it does have that Wow factor.   10', '2004-03-08 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(614401, 63627, 15129, '<td valign="top">It seems out of focus--otherwise this would be stunning.</td>', 'It seems out of focus--otherwise this would be stunning.', '2004-03-08 17:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(614410, 63494, 17166, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject.  The angled border at the lower left is really odd, though.</td>', 'Great choice of subject.  The angled border at the lower left is really odd, though.', '2004-03-08 18:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(614411, 63587, 17166, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject, nicely framed.  Would be interested in seeing how it would look with a long exposure so that the rotating stripes were motion-blured.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject, nicely framed.  Would be interested in seeing how it would look with a long exposure so that the rotating stripes were motion-blured.', '2004-03-08 18:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(614412, 63582, 17166, '<td valign="top">The statue of the other Wright Brother (?) in the foreground is a bit too prominent and distracts from an otherwise very interesting subhect.</td>', 'The statue of the other Wright Brother (?) in the foreground is a bit too prominent and distracts from an otherwise very interesting subhect.', '2004-03-08 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(614414, 63573, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like the truck.  It helps add scale and bring the picture down to earth, so that it''s not just another abstract bridge scene.</td>', 'I like the truck.  It helps add scale and bring the picture down to earth, so that it''s not just another abstract bridge scene.', '2004-03-08 18:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(614418, 63496, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful building!  Nice capture.  Shame that the trees are a bit in the way.<br/> <br/>Where is this place?</td>', 'Very beautiful building!  Nice capture.  Shame that the trees are a bit in the way. Where is this place?', '2004-03-08 18:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(614425, 63523, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!<br/> <br/>Cool how you use the ring to frame the picture.</td>', 'Very interesting photo! Cool how you use the ring to frame the picture.', '2004-03-08 18:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(614427, 63627, 8610, '<td valign="top">need to be sharper, I think also it would be more fun to se this picture in Sepia tones</td>', 'need to be sharper, I think also it would be more fun to se this picture in Sepia tones', '2004-03-08 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(614432, 63609, 10883, '<td valign="top">Hallgrímsskirkja is always a very photogenic structure.<br/> <br/>But since you have a wide/fisheye lense, it would have been a much more interesting photo if you would have gone very close to the church and taken the photo from an unusual angle.  That way the school in the background would also not be in the picture.</td>', 'Hallgrímsskirkja is always a very photogenic structure. But since you have a wide/fisheye lense, it would have been a much more interesting photo if you would have gone very close to the church and taken the photo from an unusual angle.  That way the school in the background would also not be in the picture.', '2004-03-08 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(614435, 63675, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and colors in this picture!<br/>Good composition also!<br/> <br/>I suspect that the arrangement of the equipment was out of your hands, would have been nice to have them in a better "pattern"</td>', 'Nice contrast and colors in this picture!Good composition also! I suspect that the arrangement of the equipment was out of your hands, would have been nice to have them in a better "pattern"', '2004-03-08 18:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(614437, 63659, 10883, '<td valign="top">The bike itself could be interesting, but the fore and background clutter the photo up too much.</td>', 'The bike itself could be interesting, but the fore and background clutter the photo up too much.', '2004-03-08 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(614439, 63657, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very cool place!<br/> <br/>Nice colors in this picture!</td>', 'Very cool place! Nice colors in this picture!', '2004-03-08 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
