(614513, 63238, 9098, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very original concept for this challenge, and it seems like it would be a bit difficult to photograph under these conditions but you did a really nice job.</td>', 'I think this is a very original concept for this challenge, and it seems like it would be a bit difficult to photograph under these conditions but you did a really nice job.', '2004-03-08 20:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(614519, 63587, 17377, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  the only part I would have done differently is waited for that SUV to move out of the reflection.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot!  the only part I would have done differently is waited for that SUV to move out of the reflection.  Good luck.', '2004-03-08 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(614521, 63504, 15407, '<td valign="top">You have produced a nice angle on one of the Worlds most photographed subjects.  I feel that cloning out the objects in the skyline under the bridge between the towers, would have made a more pleasing and perhaps a higher scoring photo.</td>', 'You have produced a nice angle on one of the Worlds most photographed subjects.  I feel that cloning out the objects in the skyline under the bridge between the towers, would have made a more pleasing and perhaps a higher scoring photo.', '2004-03-08 20:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(614522, 63139, 17377, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  Good luck.</td>', 'Great perspective!  Good luck.', '2004-03-08 20:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(614525, 63138, 15407, '<td valign="top">Design &amp; engineering that produced an impressive piece of art.  If you had used a post processing program on your photo you likely would have scored higher with this entry.  The color of the sky seems un-natural to me.  Perthaps removing the moon from the picture would probably have helped your score as well.  Where is this &amp; what is it?</td>', 'Design & engineering that produced an impressive piece of art.  If you had used a post processing program on your photo you likely would have scored higher with this entry.  The color of the sky seems un-natural to me.  Perthaps removing the moon from the picture would probably have helped your score as well.  Where is this & what is it?', '2004-03-08 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(614527, 63609, 15407, '<td valign="top">The sign does nothing to help this picture.  The church is an impressive bit of architecture.  The crop at the back of the church distracts.  Standing in front of the sign and recomposing the picture towards the right may have helped.  Since I do not know what was to the right /back of the church I could be completely wrong on that.</td>', 'The sign does nothing to help this picture.  The church is an impressive bit of architecture.  The crop at the back of the church distracts.  Standing in front of the sign and recomposing the picture towards the right may have helped.  Since I do not know what was to the right /back of the church I could be completely wrong on that.', '2004-03-08 21:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
