(614732, 63504, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hey!  You "stole" my idea!  Just kidding (see my previous GG bridge shots).  This is a great perspective on it.  I thought that a shot of the underneath part would be cool...  You can get to it from the North end of the bridge on the walkway that goes under the bridge.  On this one, I''d have given it a little boost in brightness using Levels.  The color otherwise is very good.</td>', 'Hey!  You "stole" my idea!  Just kidding (see my previous GG bridge shots).  This is a great perspective on it.  I thought that a shot of the underneath part would be cool...  You can get to it from the North end of the bridge on the walkway that goes under the bridge.  On this one, I''d have given it a little boost in brightness using Levels.  The color otherwise is very good.', '2004-03-08 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
