(614743, 63456, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hmm, don''t know if I like the building on the left.  You should have switched to Portrait orientation and shot just the subject.  This would also give more of a sense of height to the subject.</td>', 'Hmm, don''t know if I like the building on the left.  You should have switched to Portrait orientation and shot just the subject.  This would also give more of a sense of height to the subject.', '2004-03-08 23:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
