(615197, 63568, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter.  Looks like a pretty complicated piece of machinery.  Does the boat sit in the box to be lifted and is the box filled with water at the time?  I would love to see this baby in action.  Nice sky and I love the textures of the mchine.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent subject matter.  Looks like a pretty complicated piece of machinery.  Does the boat sit in the box to be lifted and is the box filled with water at the time?  I would love to see this baby in action.  Nice sky and I love the textures of the mchine.  Good luck.', '2004-03-09 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(615198, 63504, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the bridge, but it has been done so many times, so not getting too many points for originality.  You picked a good time of day to take the shot though.</td>', 'Nice shot of the bridge, but it has been done so many times, so not getting too many points for originality.  You picked a good time of day to take the shot though.', '2004-03-09 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(615202, 63588, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome B&amp;W treatment.  Love the curves.  By turning this image on its side you have created something very appealing and with the sky''s darkening tone it''s even better.  The sahdows also add interest to the shot.  By far one of my favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome B&W treatment.  Love the curves.  By turning this image on its side you have created something very appealing and with the sky''s darkening tone it''s even better.  The sahdows also add interest to the shot.  By far one of my favourites for this challenge.', '2004-03-09 12:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615206, 63472, 11738, '<td valign="top">Pretty good macro of the watch.  Like the low key approach to the shot.  Your choice of having the 15 Jewels upright with the rest of the text upside down is also good.</td>', 'Pretty good macro of the watch.  Like the low key approach to the shot.  Your choice of having the 15 Jewels upright with the rest of the text upside down is also good.', '2004-03-09 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
