(615451, 63234, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the angles in this shot, and the background color is really subdued.  (I guess that could be positive or negative, depending on what you are after -- I like it).</td>', 'I like the angles in this shot, and the background color is really subdued.  (I guess that could be positive or negative, depending on what you are after -- I like it).', '2004-03-09 17:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615454, 63717, 811, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this shot -- the bw, the "motion" portrayed by the arches, etc., but there is something that keeps it from really blowing me away.  Perhaps it is the cropping/framing.  Maybe more on the right and a little more on the bottom would make it feel more complete to  me.</td>', 'Overall, I like this shot -- the bw, the "motion" portrayed by the arches, etc., but there is something that keeps it from really blowing me away.  Perhaps it is the cropping/framing.  Maybe more on the right and a little more on the bottom would make it feel more complete to  me.', '2004-03-09 17:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615459, 63138, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the general colors in this, though the sky is a bit odd looking.  I also think it is effective how the picture leads up through the frame and to the top of the building/sculpture, whatever it is.</td>', 'I like the general colors in this, though the sky is a bit odd looking.  I also think it is effective how the picture leads up through the frame and to the top of the building/sculpture, whatever it is.', '2004-03-09 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(615462, 63557, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the colors and the clarity of the focus.  Generally, I like the tight crop, though I do think seeing the entire long hand would be good, too.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the colors and the clarity of the focus.  Generally, I like the tight crop, though I do think seeing the entire long hand would be good, too.', '2004-03-09 17:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(615466, 63658, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors, but the focus seems a bit soft</td>', 'Awesome colors, but the focus seems a bit soft', '2004-03-09 17:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(615485, 63139, 7535, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp!  I like the monochromatic aspect of it.</td>', 'Nice and sharp!  I like the monochromatic aspect of it.', '2004-03-09 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(615489, 63709, 7535, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge well.  Nice shot!</td>', 'This fits the challenge well.  Nice shot!', '2004-03-09 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(615492, 63432, 7535, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective.  It is nice to see another view than the "usual".</td>', 'Very interesting perspective.  It is nice to see another view than the "usual".', '2004-03-09 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(615493, 63475, 7535, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the sky and the building.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the sky and the building.', '2004-03-09 18:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615494, 63685, 7535, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  Interesting to see things that we don''t normally pay attention to.</td>', 'Nice detail.  Interesting to see things that we don''t normally pay attention to.', '2004-03-09 18:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(615496, 63234, 7535, '<td valign="top">The reflections add an interesting detail.</td>', 'The reflections add an interesting detail.', '2004-03-09 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(615498, 63588, 7535, '<td valign="top">Very crisp!  I like the black and white.</td>', 'Very crisp!  I like the black and white.', '2004-03-09 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(615512, 63523, 16636, '<td valign="top">best image in this challenge for me, I love the composition, crop, well everything in fact!!!</td>', 'best image in this challenge for me, I love the composition, crop, well everything in fact!!!', '2004-03-09 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(615576, 63422, 6667, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very nice.  My eye is quickly draw to the window and the redish floor.  I''m not sure of  my own criticism here but there seems to be too much foreground.  Either that or the water is too calm (because that''s what my eye can''t figure out).  Disturbing it to bring it out might help.  I faintly see the water''s edge in the back left but am not sure the pool is filled. That leaves me concentrating on the wrong thing.  At least I think!  None the less, every time I look at this image the rating goes higher!  BOL</td>', 'Wow!  Very nice.  My eye is quickly draw to the window and the redish floor.  I''m not sure of  my own criticism here but there seems to be too much foreground.  Either that or the water is too calm (because that''s what my eye can''t figure out).  Disturbing it to bring it out might help.  I faintly see the water''s edge in the back left but am not sure the pool is filled. That leaves me concentrating on the wrong thing.  At least I think!  None the less, every time I look at this image the rating goes higher!  BOL', '2004-03-09 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(615578, 63587, 6667, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean but very effective. Nice. BOL</td>', 'Simple and clean but very effective. Nice. BOL', '2004-03-09 19:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(615582, 63554, 6667, '<td valign="top">Love the clear clean shot and especially the colors.  I see the emphasis on pattern here rather than the design. BOL</td>', 'Love the clear clean shot and especially the colors.  I see the emphasis on pattern here rather than the design. BOL', '2004-03-09 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1);
