(615681, 63504, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wonderflul photo of the Golden Gate....Great perspective and colors.</td>', 'Wonderflul photo of the Golden Gate....Great perspective and colors.', '2004-03-09 21:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(615689, 63724, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a classic bike.  My sister actually owned one of those years ago.  Fantastic perspective, and great colors with the red and the green trees.  Good luck !</td>', 'What a classic bike.  My sister actually owned one of those years ago.  Fantastic perspective, and great colors with the red and the green trees.  Good luck !', '2004-03-09 21:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(615694, 63607, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome.....good luck with your project.  Great photo.</td>', 'Thats awesome.....good luck with your project.  Great photo.', '2004-03-09 21:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(615702, 63321, 7535, '<td valign="top">From a Mac user, I like the way you think!  This is a classic.  Nice shot!</td>', 'From a Mac user, I like the way you think!  This is a classic.  Nice shot!', '2004-03-09 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615704, 63387, 2752, '<td valign="top">I think a little less posterizing would be more effective.</td>', 'I think a little less posterizing would be more effective.', '2004-03-09 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(615706, 63547, 2752, '<td valign="top">The sharpness and color scheme are excellent..I think less would be better here.   Either show the face or the works, but not both in my humble opinion.</td>', 'The sharpness and color scheme are excellent..I think less would be better here.   Either show the face or the works, but not both in my humble opinion.', '2004-03-09 21:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(615707, 63167, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like the composition..3 styles of architecture that lead the eye from bottom to the top.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the composition..3 styles of architecture that lead the eye from bottom to the top.  Well done.', '2004-03-09 22:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(615708, 63435, 2752, '<td valign="top">Love your approach to this composition.  Very sharp and good colors.  Leaves no doubt as to what it is all about.  Well done.</td>', 'Love your approach to this composition.  Very sharp and good colors.  Leaves no doubt as to what it is all about.  Well done.', '2004-03-09 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(615710, 63472, 2752, '<td valign="top">Would it be better if you lightened it? Composition is good.</td>', 'Would it be better if you lightened it? Composition is good.', '2004-03-09 22:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615716, 63591, 17296, '<td valign="top">The clouds are beautiful in this shot, but if the focus is supposed to be the building, I think it''s a bit dark.</td>', 'The clouds are beautiful in this shot, but if the focus is supposed to be the building, I think it''s a bit dark.', '2004-03-09 22:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(615755, 63627, 17296, '<td valign="top">I wish the front of this image was in focus.</td>', 'I wish the front of this image was in focus.', '2004-03-09 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(615757, 63609, 17296, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like what the wide angle lens did to the pole.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like what the wide angle lens did to the pole.', '2004-03-09 22:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(615759, 63381, 17296, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is good... maybe a little too neat imaged...</td>', 'I think this photo is good... maybe a little too neat imaged...', '2004-03-09 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(615761, 63588, 17296, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. I love the negative space in this. I love the tones. Perfect. I scored it very highly. Bravo!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. I love the negative space in this. I love the tones. Perfect. I scored it very highly. Bravo!', '2004-03-09 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(615765, 63139, 17296, '<td valign="top">Amazing DOF! Simply amazing. I love it. I love the colors. Is this a walkway? Very nice.</td>', 'Amazing DOF! Simply amazing. I love it. I love the colors. Is this a walkway? Very nice.', '2004-03-09 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(615766, 63625, 17296, '<td valign="top">This photo is beautiful. I don''t see design or engineering, but it''s gorgeous! I especially love how crisp and bright the subjects are. Great shot!  I wonder if this is the same photographer who entered the Gathering in the last challenge... I didn''t score it a 10 because it seemed off topic to me.</td>', 'This photo is beautiful. I don''t see design or engineering, but it''s gorgeous! I especially love how crisp and bright the subjects are. Great shot!  I wonder if this is the same photographer who entered the Gathering in the last challenge... I didn''t score it a 10 because it seemed off topic to me.', '2004-03-09 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615767, 63568, 17296, '<td valign="top">This is the most amazing looking machine. It''s a boatlift? Wow. I''d love to see it in action. Beautiful composition in the photo.</td>', 'This is the most amazing looking machine. It''s a boatlift? Wow. I''d love to see it in action. Beautiful composition in the photo.', '2004-03-09 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(615768, 63432, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. I scored this highly.<br/></td>', 'Very cool perspective. I scored this highly.', '2004-03-09 22:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(615769, 63661, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. THe sepia really works here. Very nice.</td>', 'Very pretty. THe sepia really works here. Very nice.', '2004-03-09 22:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(615772, 63343, 17296, '<td valign="top">I love how the snow covers only half the trees. Is this Lake Tahoe?? Heavenly?? Sure looks like it to me.</td>', 'I love how the snow covers only half the trees. Is this Lake Tahoe?? Heavenly?? Sure looks like it to me.', '2004-03-09 23:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(615865, 63335, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully evocative. Nice sense of negative space and balance. 10</td>', 'Wonderfully evocative. Nice sense of negative space and balance. 10', '2004-03-10 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(615866, 63588, 6870, '<td valign="top">The clarity and tones here are amazing! Super work. 10</td>', 'The clarity and tones here are amazing! Super work. 10', '2004-03-10 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(615869, 63432, 6870, '<td valign="top">Astounding work. Shows design and engineering soooooo well! I love the mood and tones and colors, too. 10</td>', 'Astounding work. Shows design and engineering soooooo well! I love the mood and tones and colors, too. 10', '2004-03-10 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(615871, 63394, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and engaging work. I love the tones and composition. Good use of light. 10</td>', 'Very interesting and engaging work. I love the tones and composition. Good use of light. 10', '2004-03-10 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(615873, 63657, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very fine work. Dramatic lighting!</td>', 'Very fine work. Dramatic lighting!', '2004-03-10 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(615876, 63215, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract feel to this. Superb clarity. Good luck! 9</td>', 'Wonderful abstract feel to this. Superb clarity. Good luck! 9', '2004-03-10 00:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(615880, 63378, 6870, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and engaging. Good use of composition and point of view. 9</td>', 'Mysterious and engaging. Good use of composition and point of view. 9', '2004-03-10 00:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(615884, 63580, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen similar shots before, but none have had the clarity and flair that this one has. Fun point of view, and wonderful lighting. 9</td>', 'I''ve seen similar shots before, but none have had the clarity and flair that this one has. Fun point of view, and wonderful lighting. 9', '2004-03-10 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(615886, 63139, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dynamic use of lines and angles and light here. 9</td>', 'Dynamic use of lines and angles and light here. 9', '2004-03-10 00:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615977, 63588, 8953, '<td valign="top">My Favorite for the challenge...probably for a few others the compositon is right on and the black and white brings it home. 10</td>', 'My Favorite for the challenge...probably for a few others the compositon is right on and the black and white brings it home. 10', '2004-03-10 00:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(616212, 63573, 12352, '<td valign="top">beatutiful...although it would have been better if you had left the truck out of the picture. strong contender for this category.</td>', 'beatutiful...although it would have been better if you had left the truck out of the picture. strong contender for this category.', '2004-03-10 05:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(616218, 63576, 12352, '<td valign="top">absolutely killer pic. very strong contender for this series. the black &amp; white does a lot of justice here...especially the age and ''used'' feel of the metal. 9</td>', 'absolutely killer pic. very strong contender for this series. the black & white does a lot of justice here...especially the age and ''used'' feel of the metal. 9', '2004-03-10 05:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(616362, 63642, 16478, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. Where is this? I''m guessing South East Asia? Well done 8</td>', 'Beautiful colours. Where is this? I''m guessing South East Asia? Well done 8', '2004-03-10 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(616363, 63504, 16478, '<td valign="top">Inevitable this would feature, but well captured. Nice shot</td>', 'Inevitable this would feature, but well captured. Nice shot', '2004-03-10 07:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(616364, 63557, 16478, '<td valign="top">My fav of the clock/watch pics. Well done 8</td>', 'My fav of the clock/watch pics. Well done 8', '2004-03-10 07:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(616365, 63321, 16478, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure why but I love this photo. 8</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure why but I love this photo. 8', '2004-03-10 07:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(616419, 63523, 7339, '<td valign="top">Ok I''m not sure what place this it going to come in at 1st, 2nd or 3rd but either way this is a great shot. Very creative idea. Excellent composition and even better color (or grey) tones. I love it. <br/> <br/>It truly is a pleasure being beaten by this photo ;-) Great job.</td>', 'Ok I''m not sure what place this it going to come in at 1st, 2nd or 3rd but either way this is a great shot. Very creative idea. Excellent composition and even better color (or grey) tones. I love it.  It truly is a pleasure being beaten by this photo ;-) Great job.', '2004-03-10 08:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(616425, 63422, 7339, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one of my favorite shots in the challenge. Great lighting and control here. A very impresive shot imo. Only thing I found a bit distracting was the purple by the door and main deck area. Still love the shot. Great job<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-04 22:57:09.</i></td>', 'Wow, this is one of my favorite shots in the challenge. Great lighting and control here. A very impresive shot imo. Only thing I found a bit distracting was the purple by the door and main deck area. Still love the shot. Great job', '2004-03-10 08:33:21.000000', '2004-04-04 23:57:09.000000', 1),
(616476, 63615, 17037, '<td valign="top">Nice colors ... is this kind of post processing legal in this competition?</td>', 'Nice colors ... is this kind of post processing legal in this competition?', '2004-03-10 09:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(616528, 63519, 5391, '<td valign="top">Holy cow - we''ve got a winner!  Beautiful image.  I''m a huge fan of industrial night shots.  This conveys all kinds of motion in that flowing steam and is absolutely beautiful to look at.  10</td>', 'Holy cow - we''ve got a winner!  Beautiful image.  I''m a huge fan of industrial night shots.  This conveys all kinds of motion in that flowing steam and is absolutely beautiful to look at.  10', '2004-03-10 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(616530, 63621, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and creative.  One of the better shots I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  The only thing I''m not crazy about is the color cast.  8</td>', 'Beautiful and creative.  One of the better shots I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  The only thing I''m not crazy about is the color cast.  8', '2004-03-10 09:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(616531, 63494, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I''m distracted by the apparent tilt adjustment that''s highlighted by the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I''m distracted by the apparent tilt adjustment that''s highlighted by the frame.', '2004-03-10 09:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(616534, 63675, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Great, creative composition, excellent exposure and beautiful colors make this a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Great, creative composition, excellent exposure and beautiful colors make this a 10.', '2004-03-10 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(616550, 63722, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, the memories this brings back to me!  I had this game when I was a kid and LOVED to just set it up and watch it go!  They still make it, huh?  Okay, now that I''ve reminisced...  on to the picture...  Very nice composition - I like the edges of the board in the background adding dynamic interest to the shot and keeping the eye in the frame.  The colors add a lot of interest, also.  I''d like to see a little mouse sitting and waiting under the trap.  Overall, a 9.  Part of that may be due to the emotional factor that this made me smile in the morning before I''ve finished my coffee (no easy feat), but really, overall it''s a very fun photo!</td>', 'Oh, the memories this brings back to me!  I had this game when I was a kid and LOVED to just set it up and watch it go!  They still make it, huh?  Okay, now that I''ve reminisced...  on to the picture...  Very nice composition - I like the edges of the board in the background adding dynamic interest to the shot and keeping the eye in the frame.  The colors add a lot of interest, also.  I''d like to see a little mouse sitting and waiting under the trap.  Overall, a 9.  Part of that may be due to the emotional factor that this made me smile in the morning before I''ve finished my coffee (no easy feat), but really, overall it''s a very fun photo!', '2004-03-10 10:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(616569, 63435, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative background and nice composition.  Eye-catching saturated purple colors push this one over the top to really make it "pop" off the screen.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very creative background and nice composition.  Eye-catching saturated purple colors push this one over the top to really make it "pop" off the screen.  Nice work.', '2004-03-10 10:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(616742, 63528, 3569, '<td valign="top">angel a</td>', 'angel a', '2004-03-10 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
