(618495, 63546, 3697, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, the composition is perfect and I really like the black and white treatment. The back of the plane seems a bit bright and the left part of the from seems a touch dark, but it''s still one of the better entries this week. 8</td>', 'This is very cool, the composition is perfect and I really like the black and white treatment. The back of the plane seems a bit bright and the left part of the from seems a touch dark, but it''s still one of the better entries this week. 8', '2004-03-11 18:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
