(618515, 63588, 13897, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but, I bet it''s not slides. Great lighting and POV. Good luck with it, I''ll bet you''re in the top 10.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but, I bet it''s not slides. Great lighting and POV. Good luck with it, I''ll bet you''re in the top 10.', '2004-03-11 19:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
