(618523, 63217, 6888, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The cropping works well as does the choice to go b/w.  The composition is good and the focus is spot on.</td>', 'Very nice.  The cropping works well as does the choice to go b/w.  The composition is good and the focus is spot on.', '2004-03-11 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(618525, 63445, 6888, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this a couple times to really see what it was, that there was actually 2 separate items here.  Challenge met, composition and color is good.</td>', 'I had to look at this a couple times to really see what it was, that there was actually 2 separate items here.  Challenge met, composition and color is good.', '2004-03-11 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(618526, 63655, 6888, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Works well here.  Composition is good, maybe a touch over exposed along the beam on the left side.  The top left corner is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Works well here.  Composition is good, maybe a touch over exposed along the beam on the left side.  The top left corner is a bit distracting.', '2004-03-11 20:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(618528, 63466, 6888, '<td valign="top">Nicely done the composition is good, sepia works well.  The crop could have been a touch lower from the top to take out that thin strip along the top.  It really pulls my eye away from the rest of what is a really nice shot.</td>', 'Nicely done the composition is good, sepia works well.  The crop could have been a touch lower from the top to take out that thin strip along the top.  It really pulls my eye away from the rest of what is a really nice shot.', '2004-03-11 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(618529, 63142, 6888, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The b/w, the grain in the windows, the reflection...all well done.  The light shining on the building at the bottom is distracting and maybe even editing out the words may have been better.  Still this is very well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The b/w, the grain in the windows, the reflection...all well done.  The light shining on the building at the bottom is distracting and maybe even editing out the words may have been better.  Still this is very well done.', '2004-03-11 20:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(618536, 63238, 8637, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...the tail lights seem a little harsh...and what would have been really cool would have been to have half the car dirty, other half clean...but really like tio idea and capture.</td>', 'Cool shot...the tail lights seem a little harsh...and what would have been really cool would have been to have half the car dirty, other half clean...but really like tio idea and capture.', '2004-03-11 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(618537, 63263, 8637, '<td valign="top">Well done...neat contraption...especially the days of the week.  Little lighter shadow might have been better.</td>', 'Well done...neat contraption...especially the days of the week.  Little lighter shadow might have been better.', '2004-03-11 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(618538, 63660, 8637, '<td valign="top">What a priviliged shot...the glow is very neat...difficult one to get when they are in the hangar.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a priviliged shot...the glow is very neat...difficult one to get when they are in the hangar. ', '2004-03-11 20:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
