(619171, 63476, 14476, '<td valign="top">And somehow this apparently confusing lashup holds together whatever needs the support.  I''ve seen some of this scaffolding and marvel at the ingenuity.  Thanks for the good photograph.</td>', 'And somehow this apparently confusing lashup holds together whatever needs the support.  I''ve seen some of this scaffolding and marvel at the ingenuity.  Thanks for the good photograph.', '2004-03-12 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
