(619789, 63472, 11653, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2004-03-13 07:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(619791, 63441, 11653, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the light to dark progression of the gold color</td>', 'I like the composition and the light to dark progression of the gold color', '2004-03-13 07:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(619792, 63523, 11653, '<td valign="top">like how you framed this</td>', 'like how you framed this', '2004-03-13 07:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(619794, 63596, 11653, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2004-03-13 07:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(619802, 63530, 15002, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject, a little dark, i like the perspective</td>', 'beautiful subject, a little dark, i like the perspective', '2004-03-13 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(619803, 63615, 15002, '<td valign="top">great color and contrast</td>', 'great color and contrast', '2004-03-13 08:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(619804, 63335, 15002, '<td valign="top">a little dark, excellent crop in my opinion</td>', 'a little dark, excellent crop in my opinion', '2004-03-13 08:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(619824, 63609, 8891, '<td valign="top">This being a member''s challenge I would think if you could, you might correct the distortion from the lense on this. I does not add to the image. Neither do the buildings to the left and the road/street sign.  I really like this architecture very much and would have preferred a good detail shot to the entire image and make me want to see more.</td>', 'This being a member''s challenge I would think if you could, you might correct the distortion from the lense on this. I does not add to the image. Neither do the buildings to the left and the road/street sign.  I really like this architecture very much and would have preferred a good detail shot to the entire image and make me want to see more.', '2004-03-13 09:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(619832, 63648, 12661, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice panoramic. However, the beauty and design of the bridge is lost in the distance. It would be nicer to see the detail of the angles and intersections of the metalwork of the bridge. Not as much for improving the photo per se, but rather for enhancing the relation to the theme. Aside from that, I really like the way the bridge''s ''mountains'' play into nature''s mountains in the background and that certainly makes up for the lack of detail of the bridge. Overall, very artistic and well done.</td>', 'This is a very nice panoramic. However, the beauty and design of the bridge is lost in the distance. It would be nicer to see the detail of the angles and intersections of the metalwork of the bridge. Not as much for improving the photo per se, but rather for enhancing the relation to the theme. Aside from that, I really like the way the bridge''s ''mountains'' play into nature''s mountains in the background and that certainly makes up for the lack of detail of the bridge. Overall, very artistic and well done.', '2004-03-13 09:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(619833, 63504, 12661, '<td valign="top">The blur in the verticle suspension cables is a bit distracting. Aside from that, very nice use of colors and a spectacular perspective of Golden Gate.</td>', 'The blur in the verticle suspension cables is a bit distracting. Aside from that, very nice use of colors and a spectacular perspective of Golden Gate.', '2004-03-13 09:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(619834, 63607, 12661, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the name Rube Goldberg come to mind when I see this photograph. Very nice interpretation of the theme. You may want to consider modifying the lighting to brighten the front of the machine and make it stand out more.</td>', 'For some reason, the name Rube Goldberg come to mind when I see this photograph. Very nice interpretation of the theme. You may want to consider modifying the lighting to brighten the front of the machine and make it stand out more.', '2004-03-13 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(619835, 63213, 12661, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to guess that I am looking at a harp. Very nice use of depth of field. I bet you wished you had saved this idea for the parrellel lines chanllenge though. ;)</td>', 'I''m going to have to guess that I am looking at a harp. Very nice use of depth of field. I bet you wished you had saved this idea for the parrellel lines chanllenge though. ;)', '2004-03-13 09:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(619845, 63660, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the Enterprise. When I visited recently I had a real hard time capturing dealing with the poor lighting there. Very few of my pictures came out well, and none as well as this one.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the Enterprise. When I visited recently I had a real hard time capturing dealing with the poor lighting there. Very few of my pictures came out well, and none as well as this one.', '2004-03-13 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(619847, 63625, 9633, '<td valign="top">very nise Ilike the moovmet</td>', 'very nise Ilike the moovmet', '2004-03-13 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(619856, 63246, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love you choice of subject for the challenge, but I fear non-climbers will be lose much of the relevance. I like the lighting and the choice of black and white.</td>', 'I love you choice of subject for the challenge, but I fear non-climbers will be lose much of the relevance. I like the lighting and the choice of black and white.', '2004-03-13 10:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(619857, 63722, 12661, '<td valign="top">An extra point just for setting up the game for the photo op.</td>', 'An extra point just for setting up the game for the photo op.', '2004-03-13 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(619858, 63445, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of perspective. At first glance, I actually thought the ''flames'' where integral in the building. Excellent.</td>', 'Very nice use of perspective. At first glance, I actually thought the ''flames'' where integral in the building. Excellent.', '2004-03-13 10:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(619873, 63454, 10055, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, it seems to be a blurry. Perhaps needs to be more crisp. I haven''t blocked glass, so this might just be the true results. However, it''s neat how glass can distort things.</td>', 'Hmmm, it seems to be a blurry. Perhaps needs to be more crisp. I haven''t blocked glass, so this might just be the true results. However, it''s neat how glass can distort things.', '2004-03-13 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(619875, 63715, 10055, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract of a tire. there for a minute, I thought I was looking at a top of  a dome ceiling. Don''t for get to center it more tho as it''s just croped at the top. Perhaps adjust the curves to. It seems to be  alittle flat. However, it''s interesting. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice abstract of a tire. there for a minute, I thought I was looking at a top of  a dome ceiling. Don''t for get to center it more tho as it''s just croped at the top. Perhaps adjust the curves to. It seems to be  alittle flat. However, it''s interesting. Good luck.', '2004-03-13 11:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(619877, 63456, 10055, '<td valign="top">Those Chicago  apartments. I always loved those. The building building behind them adds to the photo. It matches the patterns found on the apartments slideing glass doors. Keeps it ballanced. Not bad photo. Perhaps use more sunlight to cast shaddows and make it have more atomosphear.</td>', 'Those Chicago  apartments. I always loved those. The building building behind them adds to the photo. It matches the patterns found on the apartments slideing glass doors. Keeps it ballanced. Not bad photo. Perhaps use more sunlight to cast shaddows and make it have more atomosphear.', '2004-03-13 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(619878, 63376, 10055, '<td valign="top">Not bad, it jsut think it''s a little harch on the high lights. But that''s just me. Over all a nice clear picture.</td>', 'Not bad, it jsut think it''s a little harch on the high lights. But that''s just me. Over all a nice clear picture.', '2004-03-13 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(619879, 63662, 10055, '<td valign="top">Perhaps have croped it more and useed more shadowing. It seems to be  a little overexposed. However, I see more protentional to all these elements within the photo. Good luck.</td>', 'Perhaps have croped it more and useed more shadowing. It seems to be  a little overexposed. However, I see more protentional to all these elements within the photo. Good luck.', '2004-03-13 11:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(619881, 63648, 13016, '<td valign="top">For starters, it''s the Richmond San RAFAEL Bridge. But regardless of the unispired title, there''s no drama,or tension. with tepid composition. No demonstration of the theme other than it''s a bridge. This is a challenge - so make it one! Explore the possibilites - exploit perspective, angles, lighting, natural drama, something. This is soooo bland.</td>', 'For starters, it''s the Richmond San RAFAEL Bridge. But regardless of the unispired title, there''s no drama,or tension. with tepid composition. No demonstration of the theme other than it''s a bridge. This is a challenge - so make it one! Explore the possibilites - exploit perspective, angles, lighting, natural drama, something. This is soooo bland.', '2004-03-13 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(619882, 63588, 10055, '<td valign="top">A wonderful black and white. I love this shot. It what I call a perfect shot. It all ballanced, the lighting, shadowing, frameing. Great job!</td>', 'A wonderful black and white. I love this shot. It what I call a perfect shot. It all ballanced, the lighting, shadowing, frameing. Great job!', '2004-03-13 12:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(619884, 63213, 10055, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, great angle, Just adjust the DOF and a bit more. It''s a lttle harsh. However, I like it.</td>', 'Hmmm, great angle, Just adjust the DOF and a bit more. It''s a lttle harsh. However, I like it.', '2004-03-13 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(619885, 63573, 10055, '<td valign="top">Nic  photo. I like this one. Just cut the truck and it would be  abit more better. The truck seems to be  in the way. Good luck.</td>', 'Nic  photo. I like this one. Just cut the truck and it would be  abit more better. The truck seems to be  in the way. Good luck.', '2004-03-13 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
