(620414, 63621, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection. The bottom of the picture takes away from the pattern. I think you wanted to capture the bottom of the hoist but I think I would have liked the picture better if you cropped it too take out the bush.</td>', 'Interesting reflection. The bottom of the picture takes away from the pattern. I think you wanted to capture the bottom of the hoist but I think I would have liked the picture better if you cropped it too take out the bush.', '2004-03-14 06:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(620415, 63217, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the way you emphasized the "Old" by making the picture in B &amp; W.</td>', 'I like the way you emphasized the "Old" by making the picture in B & W.', '2004-03-14 06:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(620416, 63555, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometric pattern. I think you could have made it a little more interesting by bringing out the color in the red horizontal pieces or by going the other way and making the picture B &amp; W.</td>', 'Interesting geometric pattern. I think you could have made it a little more interesting by bringing out the color in the red horizontal pieces or by going the other way and making the picture B & W.', '2004-03-14 06:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(620417, 63623, 3306, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits the challenge, but it just isn''t  that interesting or artistically done. Looks like just a random picture of a table and electrical apparatus. There is too much in this picture. I think I would have liked it if you zoomed in on that green plastic instrument with an interesting angle. Sorry to criticize. I know we all like to hear the good things about our pictures, but I have learned the most from the criticisms.</td>', 'Definitely fits the challenge, but it just isn''t  that interesting or artistically done. Looks like just a random picture of a table and electrical apparatus. There is too much in this picture. I think I would have liked it if you zoomed in on that green plastic instrument with an interesting angle. Sorry to criticize. I know we all like to hear the good things about our pictures, but I have learned the most from the criticisms.', '2004-03-14 06:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(620418, 63138, 3306, '<td valign="top">Now that is interesting architecture. Good angle and nice capture of the moon.</td>', 'Now that is interesting architecture. Good angle and nice capture of the moon.', '2004-03-14 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(620419, 63564, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple and too the point. I think you have locked this one up (bad pun!)</td>', 'Simple and too the point. I think you have locked this one up (bad pun!)', '2004-03-14 06:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(620420, 63528, 3306, '<td valign="top">Reflections off of metal are always hard to deal with. Your picture looks somewhat distorted in that the glass cover does not look round. Probably the angle of the shot but the clock face does look round and they don''t seem  to match. Also, I would have cropped the picture more tightly on the right side as the picture appears uneven.</td>', 'Reflections off of metal are always hard to deal with. Your picture looks somewhat distorted in that the glass cover does not look round. Probably the angle of the shot but the clock face does look round and they don''t seem  to match. Also, I would have cropped the picture more tightly on the right side as the picture appears uneven.', '2004-03-14 06:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(620421, 63518, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting building and geometrics. This is a hard picture to get because the symmetry has to be perfect to pull it off. I like the use of B &amp; W.</td>', 'Interesting building and geometrics. This is a hard picture to get because the symmetry has to be perfect to pull it off. I like the use of B & W.', '2004-03-14 06:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(620422, 63215, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting photographic and architectural effect.</td>', 'Interesting photographic and architectural effect.', '2004-03-14 06:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
