(620428, 63615, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern and angle of your shot. I like the colors and the shadows add depth. A well don modernistic picture.</td>', 'Interesting pattern and angle of your shot. I like the colors and the shadows add depth. A well don modernistic picture.', '2004-03-14 06:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(620429, 63580, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the star shaped reflections in the picture. They help to make this more than just a picture of transistors. I think I would have tried to emphasize them more by cropping the picture in a little more.</td>', 'I really like the star shaped reflections in the picture. They help to make this more than just a picture of transistors. I think I would have tried to emphasize them more by cropping the picture in a little more.', '2004-03-14 06:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
