(621751, 63722, 13610, '<td valign="top">Really great photo. I didn''t vote on unfortunately but i would have givea 7. Some suggestion to improve tyhe shot would be. <br/>1. a light from the top<br/>2. a plain background (white or black)<br/>3. more DOF<br/>4. maybe a stop more exposed.<br/> <br/>This would have been incredible but it''s great anyway!!</td>', 'Really great photo. I didn''t vote on unfortunately but i would have givea 7. Some suggestion to improve tyhe shot would be. 1. a light from the top2. a plain background (white or black)3. more DOF4. maybe a stop more exposed. This would have been incredible but it''s great anyway!!', '2004-03-15 09:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
