(621969, 63336, 16966, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments on my first challenge entry.  I admit it wasn''t the strongest of entries.  There will be more and they will be better.  When I took the shot I didn''t have the challenge in mind. "leaf" hit the nail on the head.  When I looked at the shot on the computer it made me think "What would a BMW dream about?"  At the top of the list of design and engineering for the road, it is destined to live life on the ground.  So, I thought it might dream about flying or soaring through the trees ("God''s design").  Oh well, too many beers that night I guess.  On to the next one.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments on my first challenge entry.  I admit it wasn''t the strongest of entries.  There will be more and they will be better.  When I took the shot I didn''t have the challenge in mind. "leaf" hit the nail on the head.  When I looked at the shot on the computer it made me think "What would a BMW dream about?"  At the top of the list of design and engineering for the road, it is destined to live life on the ground.  So, I thought it might dream about flying or soaring through the trees ("God''s design").  Oh well, too many beers that night I guess.  On to the next one.', '2004-03-15 11:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
