(622497, 63599, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moodville:</b></div><hr/><i> This sure looks different than the Arms Park. Good composition, wonderful clouds, nicely sharp. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Its amazing! The atmosphere inside this place is fantastic. Took this just before the Wales v France rugby match, the French won the match but we won the singing!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by moodville: This sure looks different than the Arms Park. Good composition, wonderful clouds, nicely sharp.   Its amazing! The atmosphere inside this place is fantastic. Took this just before the Wales v France rugby match, the French won the match but we won the singing!! ', '2004-03-15 16:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
