(622928, 63588, 17377, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved ribbon!  I new this photo would place when I first saw it.  It really is amazing how a simple rotation could totally change the perspective of an image.  Well done.</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved ribbon!  I new this photo would place when I first saw it.  It really is amazing how a simple rotation could totally change the perspective of an image.  Well done.', '2004-03-15 21:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(622943, 63378, 16430, '<td valign="top">This was part of the "Energy" section at the musuem. There were two different versions, one straight and this one that curved. I''m not sure what they were intended to show, since no sign was nearby, but they looked cool. This shot was taken from 10 feet, so you can imagine how large (picture not cropped)they were. It almost looked like something you were supposed to walk through, but they were behind a plexiglass panel. Thanks to everyone for your votes and comments.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was part of the "Energy" section at the musuem. There were two different versions, one straight and this one that curved. I''m not sure what they were intended to show, since no sign was nearby, but they looked cool. This shot was taken from 10 feet, so you can imagine how large (picture not cropped)they were. It almost looked like something you were supposed to walk through, but they were behind a plexiglass panel. Thanks to everyone for your votes and comments. ', '2004-03-15 21:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(623031, 63568, 4494, '<td valign="top">This one goes to show how well a pic will do if it''s unique and not seen before (or not much).  Now imagine if the shot actually included a boat or ship on this thing!!  It would win for sure!  Great job.</td>', 'This one goes to show how well a pic will do if it''s unique and not seen before (or not much).  Now imagine if the shot actually included a boat or ship on this thing!!  It would win for sure!  Great job.', '2004-03-15 23:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
