(4478807, 63523, 22301, '<td valign="top">I had lost this photo, but have just come back across it. I saw this photo early on in my photography development. I took alot from this photo and it really stuck in me to find patterns, rhythm and echoes of similar shapes in composition. Somehow I always try to do this is some way and I am glad I found it again. Now I put it in my favs as one of those stepping stone photos that reminds me of technique I strive for.<br/>Joe</td>', 'I had lost this photo, but have just come back across it. I saw this photo early on in my photography development. I took alot from this photo and it really stuck in me to find patterns, rhythm and echoes of similar shapes in composition. Somehow I always try to do this is some way and I am glad I found it again. Now I put it in my favs as one of those stepping stone photos that reminds me of technique I strive for.Joe', '2008-02-11 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 0);
